<title>UK: BOE sells net 4.389 bln stg UK gilts in July.</title>
<headline>BOE sells net 4.389 bln stg UK gilts in July.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England (BoE) sold a net 4.389 billion stg of gilt-edged stock in July after 3.608 billion in June, BoE statistics showed.</p>
<p> NET PURCHASES OF GILTS (in million stg) -  JULY   JUNE</p>
<p> Banks (a)					  60   1,199 (1,199)</p>
<p> Building societies			   -311     185   (185)</p>
<p> M4 private sector			   4,350   1,557 (1,556)</p>
<p> Overseas					  259     668   (668)</p>
<p>NOTES - (a) includes discount houses; minus sign denotes net sale; data exclude repurchase transactions with BoE; previously released data in brackets.   -- London Newsroom 44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
